  "details": "I've found an issue where objects that are directly under your Avatar Root fly away when you move. \nI've been stress testing this and it only appears to happen in the IK-beta. More specifically when using the Hip-lock feature. If i would switch to Head-lock, this problem doesn't happen. \nI've attached a screenshot that show's how it's setup and a link to the video of me demonstrating the issue. I hope this is useful to check what's up.\n(in the screenshot, the gameobject 'CombatMode' and everything in there moves away, just an empty gameobject with stuff in it)\nhttps://youtu.be/VdR1u8b5wf0",
